# SEO EXCELLENCE - SEARCH ENGINE OPTIMIZATION

## MANDATORY SEO IMPLEMENTATION
Every public-facing page MUST be optimized for search engines. These rules are NON-NEGOTIABLE for any web project.

## 1. META TAGS & STRUCTURE (CRITICAL)
```html
<!-- MANDATORY for EVERY page -->
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <!-- Title: 50-60 characters, unique per page -->
    <title>Specific Page Title | Brand Name</title>

    <!-- Meta Description: 150-160 characters, compelling -->
    <meta name="description" content="Compelling description that makes users want to click">

    <!-- Open Graph for social sharing -->
    <meta property="og:title" content="Page Title">
    <meta property="og:description" content="Page description">
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://yourdomain.com/image.jpg">
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://yourdomain.com/page">
    <meta property="og:type" content="website">

    <!-- Twitter Cards -->
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="Page Title">
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="Page description">
    <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://yourdomain.com/image.jpg">

    <!-- Canonical URL -->
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://yourdomain.com/current-page">

    <!-- Structured Data - JSON-LD -->
    <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "Your Organization Name",
        "url": "https://yourdomain.com"
    }
    </script>
</head>
```

## 2. CONTENT OPTIMIZATION (CRITICAL)
```html
<!-- Semantic HTML structure -->
<header>
    <h1>Main Page Heading (H1 - Only ONE per page)</h1>
</header>
<main>
    <section>
        <h2>Section Heading</h2>
        <h3>Subsection Heading</h3>
        <p>Content with <strong>important keywords</strong> naturally integrated</p>
    </section>
</main>
<footer><!-- Footer content --></footer>
```

## 3. PERFORMANCE OPTIMIZATION (CRITICAL)
```html
<!-- Image optimization -->
<img src="image.webp"
     alt="Descriptive alt text with keywords"
     loading="lazy"
     width="800"
     height="600">

<!-- CSS optimization -->
<link rel="preload" href="critical.css" as="style">

<!-- JavaScript optimization -->
<script defer src="main.js"></script>
```

## 4. SITEMAP & ROBOTS
```xml
<!-- sitemap.xml - UPDATE after EVERY page addition -->
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9">
    <url>
        <loc>https://yourdomain.com/</loc>
        <lastmod>2026-01-01</lastmod>
        <changefreq>weekly</changefreq>
        <priority>1.0</priority>
    </url>
</urlset>
```

```txt
# robots.txt
User-agent: *
Allow: /
Disallow: /admin/
Disallow: /api/
Disallow: /config/
Disallow: /includes/

Sitemap: https://yourdomain.com/sitemap.xml
```

## 5. CORE WEB VITALS (CRITICAL)
- **Largest Contentful Paint (LCP)**: < 2.5 seconds
- **Interaction to Next Paint (INP)**: < 200 milliseconds
- **Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS)**: < 0.1

```css
/* Prevent layout shift */
img, video { width: 100%; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 16/9; }
```

