## 7. INTERNAL LINKING
```html
<nav aria-label="Main navigation">
    <a href="/services" title="Our Services">Services</a>
    <a href="/about" title="About Us">About</a>
</nav>
<!-- Contextual internal links in content -->
<p>Learn more about our <a href="/advanced-services">advanced services</a>.</p>
```

## 8. SCHEMA MARKUP (JSON-LD)
Use appropriate schema types per page:
- **Organization**: Company/brand pages
- **BreadcrumbList**: All pages with breadcrumb navigation
- **FAQPage**: FAQ sections
- **Product**: Product pages
- **Article**: Blog posts
- **LocalBusiness**: Local business sites
- **SoftwareApplication**: SaaS/app sites
- **VideoObject**: Pages with video content

## 9. CONTENT GUIDELINES
- **Keyword Density**: 1-2% natural integration
- **Content Length**: Minimum 300 words per page
- **Readability**: Flesch Reading Ease score > 60
- **Unique Content**: 100% original, no duplicate content
- **Heading Hierarchy**: H1 > H2 > H3 (never skip levels)

## 10. TECHNICAL SEO CHECKLIST
- [ ] SSL certificate (HTTPS)
- [ ] Clean URL structure (no file extensions)
- [ ] Fast loading speed (< 3 seconds)
- [ ] Mobile-responsive design
- [ ] XML sitemap submitted to Google Search Console
- [ ] Google Analytics and Search Console configured
- [ ] Custom 404 error page
- [ ] 301 redirects for changed URLs
- [ ] No broken links
- [ ] Images optimized (WebP, lazy-loaded, with alt text)

## IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENT
Every public page MUST score 90+ on Google PageSpeed Insights. SEO is built into every line of code, not bolted on afterward.
